      "updated_at": "2026-05-24T19:29:32.750Z",
      "author": 5,
      "title": "Supply Cache Rotation - Quarterly Audit",
      "title_nonce": null,
      "body": "All supply masters: conduct inventory immediately. Report discrepancies to command. We've had tracking issues at Depot 3. Also rotating out expired medications and food rations. New supplies arriving via Cache 7.",
